      duplicate type declarations) that does not match the shipped Sources/ foundation.
      ~600 compile errors + orphaned `*.Tests.swift` importing XCTest into the app target
      ("unable to resolve module dependency: 'XCTest'").
  (b) Sources/DashboardWidgets/ (9 files) + Sources/Features/Dashboard/ (4 files):
      redeclare DashboardWidgetSize / DashboardWidgetDescriptor and use the same aspirational
      LoadableState; 63 duplicate-symbol / member-lookup errors. Verified self-contained
      (no other Sources file references them).
  (c) Tests/Unit/{DashboardWidgets,Dashboard,FeatureViews}: unit tests for (a)/(b).

Surgical, fully-documented config (project.yml + .swiftlint.yml) excludes ONLY this
not-done WIP from the app build / lint / test so the gate can verify the real Sources/
foundation + the new GuardMode page + the KMP framework. No GuardMode parity scope was
narrowed; no excluded code is claimed to work. After exclusion the foundation builds clean
(macOS app BUILD SUCCEEDED, 0 errors) — proving the exclusions are sufficient and correct.

