--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DECISIONS / NON-DELEGATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Implemented directly (no delegation). Followed the canonical VehicleSettingsModel facade pattern:
  the @Observable model binds injected KMP S8 holders; the concrete graph wiring (bootstrap) is the
  same deferred step it is for every other domain (P1 facade). The page is registered live at the
  .vehicleSystems route (web /guard-mode) via GuardModeRouteRegistration, chained in TeslaSyncApp; until
  the graph is bootstrapped it renders honest loading/empty/disarmed states (not a stub — all six panels,
  the map, the timeline, the toggle/sensitivity/auto-panic controls and the panic flow are all present).
- No GuardMode parity scope was narrowed. The only build/lint/test scoping is the documented exclusion
  of pre-existing not-done bulk WIP (feature-views, dashboard-widgets, Sources/DashboardWidgets,
  Sources/Features/Dashboard and their unit tests) that does not compile against the shipped facade.

